1
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,030
Thank you.

2
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,300
Don't mention it.

3
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:54,100
I just figured I'd have wine to drink here tonight,

4
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,430
so I dropped by.

5
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:58,230
Taoist, you just said he'd have a bloody disaster,

6
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,460
and he fell right on the spot.

7
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:01,360
Are you the legendary master?

8
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:03,630
Actually,

9
00:01:04,330 --> 00:01:04,930
I was just guessing.

10
00:01:04,930 --> 00:01:05,500
That...

11
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,430
That works too?

12
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:08,160
Miss, your face shows you are of noble birth.

13
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:09,430
But the past is like a knife.

14
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:10,500
The tighter you chase it,

15
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:11,430
the deeper it cuts.

16
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:12,630
Don't chase the past.

17
00:01:12,930 --> 00:01:13,500
Live in the present.

18
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,100
The tighter you chase it,

19
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:14,760
the deeper it cuts.

20
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,430
Don't chase the past.

21
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:16,560
Live in the present.

22
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:18,200
Taoist, do you know something?

23
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,260
Do you know who I am?

24
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:24,830
What is this?

25
00:01:24,830 --> 00:01:25,630
Shiyi Pavilion in the west of the city.

26
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:26,830
Look for Granny Liao.

27
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:28,560
The answers you seek are there.

28
00:01:30,030 --> 00:01:30,960
Shiyi Pavilion.

29
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,420
The end of the west of the city.

30
00:01:33,530 --> 00:01:36,130
Where exactly is the end of the west of the city?

31
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,530
I'm telling you.

32
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:45,830
I bought this stone piece from the black market for 100 taels.

33
00:01:45,830 --> 00:01:46,860
It must be real.

34
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:47,560
Bah!

35
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,759
Your stone piece is fake.

36
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:49,860
Mine is the real one.

37
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:50,960
I spent 200 taels.

38
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,229
The guy who sold it to me said,

39
00:01:52,229 --> 00:01:53,430
Granny Liao only recognizes this.

40
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:54,530
Calm down, you two.

41
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:55,960
As far as I know,

42
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:58,060
there's no real or fake stone piece.

43
00:01:58,060 --> 00:02:00,160
The key is whether it can open the door of Shiyi Pavilion.

44
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,160
Why don't we go together?

45
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,260
We can look out for each other.

46
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,720
A poor scholar like you has a stone piece too?

47
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,490
It's a family heirloom.

48
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:12,560
Are you guys

49
00:02:13,060 --> 00:02:14,660
going to Shiyi Pavilion too?

50
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,020
And who are you?

51
00:02:18,230 --> 00:02:19,160
I have this.

52
00:02:25,329 --> 00:02:26,960
Since we're all heading the same way,

53
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,260
let's go together.

54
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,760
We all know the rules of Shiyi Pavilion.

55
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,560
If you have a stone piece, your request will be granted.

56
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,960
But it's not easy to find.

57
00:02:34,130 --> 00:02:35,460
More people make things easier.

58
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:36,260
Right.

59
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:37,360
Let's go together.

60
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,020
We can look out for each other.

61
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:41,560
I find it boring to be alone anyway.

62
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,820
The more, the merrier.

63
00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:43,560
Okay.

64
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:44,960
Let's go then.

65
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:50,960
I'm telling you guys.

66
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,960
I'm looking for Granny Liao for wealth.

67
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,620
If she can really change fate,

68
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:56,030
I'll ask her to let me be reincarnated

69
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:57,630
into a bank owner's family in my next life,

70
00:02:57,630 --> 00:02:59,890
so I can count money until my hands cramp.

71
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:01,630
Look at you.

72
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,330
I'm going to pray for a good marriage.

73
00:03:03,330 --> 00:03:04,630
I've married three men,

74
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,600
and all of them died young.

75
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,800
The third one broke his leg on our wedding day,

76
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,330
stayed in bed for half a year, and then passed away.

77
00:03:09,330 --> 00:03:11,130
Now matchmakers avoid me when they see me.

78
00:03:11,130 --> 00:03:12,930
I need Granny Liao to tell my fortune.

79
00:03:12,930 --> 00:03:14,990
What sins did I commit in my past life?

80
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:16,700
What you two seek are worldly things.

81
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:19,130
I'm going to Granny Liao to pray for my future.

82
00:03:19,130 --> 00:03:20,800
I've studied hard for twelve years,

83
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,300
but I haven't even passed the county exam.

84
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,800
Someone must have stolen my academic luck.

85
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,500
I want her to change my fate

86
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:25,700
and get my academic luck back.

87
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:26,630
You're just stupid.

88
00:03:26,630 --> 00:03:26,700
It's because you're stupid.

89
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:28,260
What does it have to do with academic luck?

90
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,030
You!

91
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,490
You're all asking her to change your fate.

92
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:34,160
What else?

93
00:03:34,460 --> 00:03:36,590
Little girl, what are you praying for?

94
00:03:38,130 --> 00:03:38,660
I

95
00:03:39,530 --> 00:03:40,760
want to know who I am.

96
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:44,860
Oh,

97
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:46,460
what's so good about knowing that?

98
00:03:46,460 --> 00:03:47,860
Does it matter who you are?

99
00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:49,790
Living a good life is what matters.

100
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:51,130
Do you know who I am?

101
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:54,160
My first three husbands all died young,

102
00:03:54,230 --> 00:03:56,100
but I'm still living well, aren't I?

103
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:57,829
What can you do even if you know?

104
00:04:06,860 --> 00:04:08,060
According to the map,

105
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:10,390
we should be there in another three miles.

106
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,060
Oh my god!

107
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:26,660
This... this is a monster!

108
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:27,730
Run!

109
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:32,659
Run faster, young man!

110
00:04:32,659 --> 00:04:33,600
Don't dawdle!

111
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:53,760
It's afraid of me.

112
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:55,560
Why?

113
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,130
It seems

114
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,930
Shiyi Pavilion is nearby.

115
00:05:35,330 --> 00:05:36,900
What a cute little pig.

116
00:05:39,730 --> 00:05:41,830
That's my gatekeeping spirit beast,

117
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:43,560
the Spirit Pig.

118
00:05:44,230 --> 00:05:46,430
You must be the master of Shiyi Pavilion,

119
00:05:46,430 --> 00:05:47,330
Granny Liao.

120
00:05:49,330 --> 00:05:51,430
Someone who can even scare the Spirit Pig,

121
00:05:51,430 --> 00:05:53,430
this is the first time I've seen one.

122
00:05:53,630 --> 00:05:54,130
Me?

123
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:55,560
Could it be

124
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:58,130
that the beast just now was transformed from it?

125
00:05:58,130 --> 00:06:01,860
The Spirit Pig has guarded my Shiyi Pavilion for hundreds of years.

126
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:04,430
What kind of place do you think this is?

127
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,130
Do you think anyone can just come here?

128
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,400
I see.

129
00:06:08,830 --> 00:06:10,230
This was all a test.

130
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:11,430
Tell me,

131
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:14,930
what do you want from my Shiyi Pavilion?

132
00:06:20,930 --> 00:06:22,400
I want to know who I am.

133
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,930
The fruit of past and present lives.

134
00:06:29,930 --> 00:06:32,430
What you want is too heavy.

135
00:06:33,230 --> 00:06:35,000
If you want to know all this,

136
00:06:35,230 --> 00:06:38,230
you must bear the cost of knowing the truth.

137
00:06:38,730 --> 00:06:40,730
Are you sure you can accept it?

138
00:06:41,130 --> 00:06:42,630
I beg you to help me, Granny.
